        "text": "Page: Liaoyang. Sentence: Liaoyang () is a prefecture-level city of east-central Liaoning province, People's Republic of China, situated on the T'ai-tzu River and, together with Anshan, forms a metro area of 2,057,200 inhabitants in 2010.\nPage: Changchun. Sentence: According to the 2010 census of China, Changchun had a total population of 7,674,439 under its jurisdiction.\nPage: Yuan Baojing. Sentence: Yuan Baojing (; 16 February 1966 – 17 March 2006) was a Chinese billionaire from Liaoyang, Liaoning province.\nPage: Northeast Normal University. Sentence: Northeast Normal University (; often abbreviated NENU or 东北师大) is one of the six national normal universities in the People's Republic of China, located in Changchun, Jilin province.",
